    "content": "Yea, looks like buildoor constructed payload attributes itself as it didn't get any from the node in time:\n```\n┌──────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│     Time     │                                                      Event                                                      │\n├──────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 12:18:57.06  │ Teku emits attributes for 172895; buildoor builds normally                                                      │\n├──────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 12:19:03     │ Slot 172895 empty                                                                                               │\n├──────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│              │ Fallback timer fires at build start time (-2900 ms), no attributes for 172896 yet. Buildoor logs \"Synthesized   │\n│ 12:19:09.101 │ attributes cross an epoch boundary\" and \"re-using the last available attributes\" from 172895, then starts the   │\n│              │ parent_full build                                                                                               │\n├──────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 12:19:09.904 │ Teku emits the real attributes for 172896 (same parent 0x5a50…). Buildoor logs the receipt but does nothing:    │\n│              │ the pass is in flight and the parent hash is the same variant, so no new candidate                              │\n├──────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 12:19:11.27  │ Payload 0xb0d7… built from the synthesized attributes                                                           │\n├──────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 12:19:11.61  │ Bid submitted, accepted into block 172896                                                                       │\n├──────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ 12:19:17.01  │ Reveal; Teku rejects with \"Withdrawals of the envelope are not consistent with the expected withdrawals in the  │\n│              │ state\"                                                                                                          │\n└──────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\nwill fix buildoor to abort the build and use the attributes when supplied late",
